  /// The Base64 encoded, 160-bit SHA1 digest of the object. This checksum is
  /// only present if the checksum was uploaded with the object. For more
  /// information, see Checking object integrity in the Amazon S3 User Guide .
  pub checksum_sha1: Str? = None
  /// The Base64 encoded, 256-bit SHA256 digest of the object. This checksum
  /// is only present if the checksum was uploaded with the object. For more
  /// information, see Checking object integrity in the Amazon S3 User Guide .
  pub checksum_sha256: Str? = None
  /// The Base64 encoded, 512-bit SHA512 digest of the object. This checksum
  /// is only present if the object was uploaded with the SHA512 checksum
  /// algorithm. For more information, see Checking object integrity in the
  /// Amazon S3 User Guide .
