  /// exists, is active and has a resource policy granting access to the S3
  /// service principals ' maintenance.s3tables.amazonaws.com ' and '
  /// metadata.s3.amazonaws.com '. To create a new metadata table, you must
  /// delete the metadata configuration for this bucket, and then create a new
